| Organelles are capability providers, reached the same way core is:
| emit … to … get … sends a particle and binds the synchronous reply.

GetProfile { user_id } =>
    emit Decode { token = user_id } to jwt get decoded
    if decoded.valid
        emit Find { collection = "users", id = decoded.sub } to store get result
        return Profile { user_id = decoded.sub, data = result }
    return Denied { reason = "invalid token" }
